values.content:
=You are a professional Dubai real estate sales assistant for Zenith Group.

Your task is to draft a personalized professional Email and WhatsApp response for a real estate lead.

LEAD INFORMATION

Name: {{ $json.Name || '' }}
Email: {{ $json.Email || '' }}
Phone: {{ $json.Phone || '' }}
Message: {{ $json.Message || '' }}
Website: {{ $json.Website || '' }}
Budget: {{ $json.Budget || 'Not specified' }}
Area Preference: {{ $json.AreaPreference || 'Not specified' }}
AI Priority: {{ $json.AIPriority || 'Not Classified' }}
AI Lead Score: {{ $json.AILeadScore || 0 }}
AI Lead Type: {{ $json.AILeadType || 'Not Classified' }}
Language: {{ $json.Language || 'English' }}
Sentiment: {{ $json.Sentiment || 'Unknown' }}
Investment Type: {{ $json.InvestmentType || 'Not specified' }}
Property Type: {{ $json.PropertyType || 'Not specified' }}
ROI Interest: {{ $json.ROIInterest || 'Not specified' }}

INSTRUCTIONS

Create a professional response based on the customer's actual enquiry.

Email:
- Personalize using the customer's name.
- Acknowledge their enquiry.
- Do not invent property prices, ROI percentages, projects, locations, availability, or guarantees.
- If Budget or Area Preference is not provided, do not pretend that it was provided.
- Encourage the customer to continue the discussion with the Zenith Group property development team.
- Keep the email professional, clear and concise.

WhatsApp:
- Keep it under 80 words.
- Personalize with the customer's name.
- Directly acknowledge their enquiry.
- Keep the tone professional and friendly.
- Encourage further discussion.

Use this exact email signature:

Kind regards,
Zenith Group
Dubai Property Development Team

Return ONLY valid JSON.

Do not use markdown.
Do not use ```json.
Do not include any explanation before or after the JSON.

Use exactly this structure:

{
  "Subject": "",
  "EmailDraft": "",
  "WhatsAppDraft": ""
}

parameters.jsCode:
const webhook = $('Lead Webhook (HTTP)').first().json.body || {};
const items = $input.all();

return items.map(item => {
  const j = item.json || {};

  let aiData =
    j.output?.[0]?.content?.[0]?.text ??
    j.text ??
    j.message?.content ??
    {};

  // Parse AI response if it is returned as text
  if (typeof aiData === 'string') {
    aiData = aiData
      .replace(/```json/gi, '')
      .replace(/```/g, '')
      .trim();

    try {
      aiData = JSON.parse(aiData);
    } catch (error) {
      aiData = {};
    }
  }

  return {
    json: {
      Name:
        webhook.Name ||
        webhook.name ||
        '',

      Email:
        webhook.Email ||
        webhook.email ||
        '',

      Message:
        webhook.Message ||
        webhook.message ||
        '',

      'AI Budget':
        aiData['AI Budget'] ||
        aiData.AIBudget ||
        aiData.Budget ||
        '',

      Phone:
        webhook.Phone ||
        webhook.phone ||
        webhook.Mobile ||
        webhook.mobile ||
        '',

      'AI Area Preference':
        aiData['AI Area Preference'] ||
        aiData.AIAreaPreference ||
        aiData.AreaPreference ||
        '',

      'Date Received':
        webhook['Date Received'] ||
        webhook.Date ||
        webhook.date ||
        new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
          timeZone: 'Asia/Dubai'
        }),

      'Time Received':
        webhook['Time Received'] ||
        webhook.Time ||
        webhook.time ||
        new Date().toLocaleTimeString('en-US', {
          timeZone: 'Asia/Dubai',
          hour: '2-digit',
          minute: '2-digit',
          hour12: true
        }),

      'Page URL':
        webhook['Page URL'] ||
        webhook.PageURL ||
        webhook.page_url ||
        webhook.url ||
        '',

      Subject:
        aiData.Subject ||
        'Your property enquiry',

      EmailDraft:
        aiData.EmailDraft ||
        '',

      WhatsAppDraft:
        aiData.WhatsAppDraft ||
        ''
    }
  };
});

